                        "content": "A client with chronic kidney disease has completed a hemodialysis treatment. The nurse would use which standard indicators to evaluate the client's status after dialysis?",
                        "subjectId": "ad5ab04c79144c0ea9b83385308c3b1d",
                        "difficultyIds": "a0f7d178f7b728b8bba7ef20ddeca62d",
                        "difficulty": "考试范围-Evaluating 评价",
                        "textAnalysis": "Rationale:\nFollowing dialysis the client's vital signs are monitored to determine whether the client is remaining hemodynamically stable. Weight is measured and compared with the client's predialysis weight to determine effectiveness of fluid extraction. Laboratory studies are done as per protocol but are not necessarily done after the hemodialysis treatment has ended.",
                        "id": "106bac143f294d599c0413ce122032f0",
                        "mark": "0",
                        "collectionState": "0"
                    },
                    {
                        "optionList": [
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "336ad454a18c4170a0d097b422a43d5d",
                                "content": "Bradycardia"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "1",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "f59be8b4abe94aff8fac073f4a78d3c1",
                                "content": "Hypertension"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "1eb35a7b8b0a43f69d8ee78fccf4fd1d",
                                "content": "Decreased cardiac output"
                            },
                            {
                                "isRight": "0",
                                "userAnswer": "",
                                "isSelected": "0",
                                "id": "63fdc7fc8e144a9e99aab74236c88da8",
                                "content": "Decreased central venous pressure"
                            }
                        ],
                        "extJson": {
                            "optionList": [
